A melancholic Italian folk ballad beginning with an intricate solo acoustic guitar intro featuring hammer-ons and pull-offs. A warm male vocal enters over strummed chords, soon joined by a clear female vocalist for duet sections that build emotional tension. The chorus swells into a powerful anthem with both voices harmonized supported by rhythmic accordion-like synth pads and more forceful guitar work. An expressive instrumental break showcases a lively interplay between melodic acoustic guitar runs and accordion phrases before returning to the climactic final choruses and fading out on a gentle acoustic guitar figure.

